<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 400 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 400 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 400 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.15 BLN   1.15 BLN    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    365 MLN    765 MLN!   =	    =</p>
<p> BAND 1  BANK BILLS   15 MLN*    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> BAND 2  BANK BILLS   50 MLN*    300 MLN*   =	    =</p>
<p>! INCLUDES 400 MLN STG REPO EXPIRING JANUARY 20 AT 5-31/32 PCT</p>
<p>(INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-15/16 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
